usage: refine_one.py [-h] [--backend {diffbragg,nanobrag}] -e EXPTNAME -r
                     REFLNAME -i EXPTIDX -o OUTFILE -m MASKFILE -z MTZFILE
                     [-c MTZCOL]

Refine a single experiment using DiffBragg or nanobrag_torch backend.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --backend {diffbragg,nanobrag}
                        Backend to use: 'diffbragg' (default, legacy) or
                        'nanobrag' (PyTorch-based)
  -e EXPTNAME, --exptName EXPTNAME
                        Path to the DIALS experiment list (.json) file.
  -r REFLNAME, --reflName REFLNAME
                        Path to the DIALS reflection table (.refl) file.
  -i EXPTIDX, --exptIdx EXPTIDX
                        The integer index (id) of the experiment to be refined
                        from the experiment list and reflection table.
  -o OUTFILE, --outFile OUTFILE
                        Output HDF5 file path for ROI results
  -m MASKFILE, --maskFile MASKFILE
                        Detector mask file path
  -z MTZFILE, --mtzFile MTZFILE
                        MTZ file containing structure factors
  -c MTZCOL, --mtzCol MTZCOL
                        MTZ column names (default: F,SIGF)
